{"question": "根据《资本工具合格标准》，下列哪项表述正确？", "answer": "答案为 其他一级资本工具自发行之日起至少5年后方可由发行银行赎回，且行使赎回权前应经监管认可。[1]", "is_final_answer": true, "mode": "choice_evidence_deterministic", "generation_status": "completed", "used_chunks": 8, "refused": false, "refusal_reason": null, "confidence": 0.8553702159215575, "citation_count": 1}
